@startuml fig2_voice_pipeline_sequence
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam BoxPadding 10

box "Client & Network Edge" #E0F2FE
actor "User" as U
participant "LiveKit SFU\n(WebRTC Edge)" as SFU
end box

box "VoCall Core Orchestration" #F1F5F9
participant "Silero VAD\n(Endpointing)" as VAD
participant "FastAPI Orchestrator\n(Async Loop)" as ORCH
end box

box "Inference & Synthesis Engines" #FDF2F8
participant "Groq LPU\n(Llama-3.3-70B)" as LLM
participant "Cartesia Sonic-2\n(State-Space TTS)" as TTS
end box

== 1. Audio Ingestion & Boundary Endpointing ==
U -> SFU: Continuous 48kHz Opus Audio Stream
SFU -> VAD: Decoded 16kHz PCM Chunks (20ms frames)
VAD -> VAD: Compute Speech Probability P(speech)
note over VAD: Speech Boundary Verified\nSilence > 300ms (EOS)\nLatency: ~85ms
VAD -> ORCH: Utterance Completed Event (Audio Segment)

== 2. Speculative Inference & Memory Grounding ==
ORCH -> LLM: Stream Token Prompt + In-Context Memory
activate LLM
note over LLM: Time-to-First-Token (TTFT)\n<= 165ms P95
LLM -->> ORCH: Stream First Token Chunk ("Certainly, I can...")
ORCH -> TTS: Stream Synthesized Text Chunks
activate TTS
note over TTS: Audio Chunk Synthesis\nLatency: ~78ms
TTS -> SFU: Encoded Opus Frames (20ms RTP Packets)
SFU -> U: Playback Voice Stream to User
note over U,SFU: Total Mean Turnaround: 408ms P95

== 3. Barge-In Interruption Lifecycle ==
alt User Interrupts Mid-Playback (Barge-in)
    U -> SFU: User Speaks ("Wait, stop that...")
    SFU -> VAD: Ingest Mid-Speech Audio Frames
    VAD -> VAD: Energy & RMS Exceeds Speech Threshold
    VAD -> ORCH: Immediate Interruption Detected Event
    
    group Asynchronous Latency Mitigation (< 35ms)
        ORCH -> SFU: Dispatch WebRTC Buffer Clear Command
        SFU -> U: Immediate Playback Mute / Buffer Dropped
        ORCH -> LLM: Cancel Active asyncio Generation Task
        deactivate LLM
        ORCH -> TTS: Terminate Streaming WebSocket Frame
        deactivate TTS
    end
    
    ORCH -> ORCH: Re-initialize Context for New Utterance
end
@enduml
